{
  "notes": [
    "Prototype 3D figure appearance (spike3d). Portrait id or species|gender maps to a procedural hair style and colour so the board figure reads as the same person as the portrait.",
    "genderPresets scale the shared skeleton (shoulders, hips, chest, height) — not separate anim trees.",
    "hairStyles are built in HumanoidModel.setHair. Non-human races use unique placeholder meshes on the shared rig (src/spike3d/raceMeshes/); humans keep the default head.",
    "Uniforms use discrete coloured tunic textures per Starfleet division (command / operations / sciences) under public/art/models/characters/shared/ — no mask shader.",
    "mixedHeritage and newSpecies use the human mesh. Optional GLB overrides: public/art/models/characters/{species}-{gender}.glb."
  ],
